layout: template.njk
slug: change-order-remodelers
title: Change order template for remodelers (free PDF) | Jobchit
description: A free, printable change-order form for remodelers. The change, the price and schedule effect, the new contract total and both signatures. No account needed.
heading: Change order for remodelers
sub: One page for every change on a kitchen, bath or bigger job. Fill it in, get both signatures before the extra work starts, and each keep a copy.
tips:
  - Number each change order and attach it to the original contract.
  - Write the change so someone who wasn't there can tell what was agreed.
  - Put the price change in dollars and cents, with a plus or minus, and work out the new contract total.
  - Both sides sign and date it before the extra work starts. Give the customer a copy.
  - Some states have their own rules for change orders. Check with your state licensing board.
---
